---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "A Simple Add-On That Protects Your Smile",
  "description": "Protect your teeth from decay and sensitivity with professional fluoride application during your cleaning.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Dentiq Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Houston"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Fluoride Cleanings Houston | ${site.name}`}
  description="Protect your teeth from decay and sensitivity with professional fluoride application during your cleaning."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      A Simple Add-On That Protects Your Smile
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Protect your teeth from decay and sensitivity with professional fluoride application during your cleaning.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">Fluoride is found in everyday dental products like toothpaste and mouthwash, and it helps strengthen enamel so teeth are less likely to get cavities. Even with great brushing at home, a professional fluoride treatment adds an extra layer of protection. Fluoride treatments are especially helpful for kids and teens still building consistent brushing habits, and for adults who are more prone to cavities or sensitivity.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Cleaning</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>A professional fluoride treatment adds an extra layer of protection beyond at-home brushing</p>
      <p>Quick, simple option for both kids and adults</p>
      <p>Especially helpful for kids and teens who are still building consistent brushing and flossing habits</p>
      <p>Fluoride is applied to the teeth, then patients avoid eating or drinking for about an hour so the fluoride can fully do its job</p>
      <p>Fluoride can reduce cavities by up to 25%</p>
      <p>Most people need one fluoride treatment every six months</p>
      <p>People who are at high risk for cavities may need more frequent treatments</p>
      <p>Fluoride treatments help to reverse early signs of tooth decay</p>
      <p>Fluoride gel is applied to the teeth using a small brush or tray during treatment</p>
      <p>Safe for both adults and children</p>
      <p>Children should get a fluoride treatment every 6 months</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
